HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A sshh command, the Thompson shell, appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.  It
     was superseded in Version 7 AT&T UNIX by the Bourne shell, which inher‐
     ited the name sshh.

     This version of sshh was rewritten in 1989 under the BSD license after the
     Bourne shell from AT&T System V Release 4 UNIX and first appeared in
     4.3BSD Net/2.

